{
  "chapter": "patterns/security/output-guardrail",
  "tier": "micro",
  "notes": [
    "Patterns are literal secrets known to the run — an API key and an internal hostname —",
    "not a classifier. Redaction replaces every occurrence; a credential is blocked outright",
    "because a response built around a leaked key is not worth salvaging.",
    "Rules are applied in declaration order, and blocking wins over redacting."
  ],
  "rules": [
    { "pattern": "sk-ant-secret", "action": "block", "label": "credential" },
    { "pattern": "db-01.internal", "action": "redact", "label": "hostname" }
  ],
  "cases": [
    {
      "id": "clean-output-passes-through",
      "text": "Your order was delivered on the 3rd.",
      "result": { "released": true, "text": "Your order was delivered on the 3rd.", "hits": [] }
    },
    {
      "id": "a-redactable-secret-is-masked",
      "text": "Query db-01.internal for the row.",
      "result": {
        "released": true,
        "text": "Query [redacted:hostname] for the row.",
        "hits": ["hostname"]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "every-occurrence-is-redacted",
      "text": "db-01.internal talks to db-01.internal",
      "result": {
        "released": true,
        "text": "[redacted:hostname] talks to [redacted:hostname]",
        "hits": ["hostname"]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a-credential-blocks-the-whole-response",
      "text": "Use sk-ant-secret to authenticate.",
      "result": { "released": false, "text": "", "hits": ["credential"] }
    },
    {
      "id": "blocking-wins-over-redacting",
      "text": "sk-ant-secret reaches db-01.internal",
      "result": { "released": false, "text": "", "hits": ["credential", "hostname"] }
    },
    {
      "id": "a-blocked-response-releases-nothing-not-a-partial",
      "text": "Everything is fine. Also sk-ant-secret. Nothing to see.",
      "result": { "released": false, "text": "", "hits": ["credential"] }
    },
    {
      "id": "a-label-is-reported-once-however-many-times-it-hits",
      "text": "db-01.internal db-01.internal db-01.internal",
      "result": {
        "released": true,
        "text": "[redacted:hostname] [redacted:hostname] [redacted:hostname]",
        "hits": ["hostname"]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "empty-output-is-clean",
      "text": "",
      "result": { "released": true, "text": "", "hits": [] }
    }
  ]
}
